      "text": "President Trump’s message has been simple and consistent from the beginning:\n\nTo countries around the world — bring us your best offers, and President Trump will listen.\n\nDeals will only be made if they benefit American workers and address our Nation’s crippling trade deficits.\n\nAmerica does not need other countries as much as other countries need us.\n\nPresident Trump knows this.\n\nHe’s going to use the leverage of our market and our country to the advantage of the people he represents.\n\nOn the other hand, countries like China who retaliate and try to double down on their mistreatment of America are making a gigantic mistake.\n\nPresident Trump has a spine of steel.\n\nAmerica will not bend, and we will not break under his leadership.\n\nPresident Trump is guided by a firm belief that America must be able to produce essential goods for our own people and export them to the rest of the world.",
